{"unit_id":"whiteS18__dsh-mcp-servers-panel#feature-1","repo":"whiteS18/dsh-mcp-servers-panel","commit":"273f5677d2603ca9ea96316ecefb5759d2f0a9c1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-servers-panel 的功能「MCP 服务器 Profile 管理」：用户在设置面板新增、编辑或删除服务器；配置会写入当前 Profile 的 cordis.patch.yml，面板只管理自己的条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2005","index.js:473","index.js:565"]}
